SUMMARY:Feast of Agios Spyridon\, patron of Elafonisos
LOCATION:Elafonisos (harbour church)\, Elafonisos\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The patron's winter feast at the church of Agios Spyridon on the harbour on 12 December: vespers on the 11th\, liturgy and a procession of the icon along the quay on the 12th\, and a reception offered by the parish. The island has a few hundred winter residents and one or two kafeneia open\; the ferry from Pounta runs all year.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/elafonisos/#elafonisos-harbour-church-feast-of-agios-spyridon-patron-of-
